[h1]I.Bug fixes[/h1]
1.Fix the bug of returning to the main menu without "continue" button after starting a new game;

[h1]II. Optimize game content[/h1]
1.Optimize farmer AI and adjust farmer values;
2.Adjust the values of monsters to reduce their occurrence frequency;
3.Adjust the values of buildings to increase working duration;
4.Add text instructions for Farmer "YellowCute" fishing operation

Welcome everyone to make positive comments and provide valuable suggestions and feedback. If you have any questions, we will reply immediately. Thank you for your attention and support!

[h1]I.Bug fixes[/h1]
1. Fix the bug of not being able to enter the game after adding the resolution option function;
2. Fix the bug of repeatedly generating pinenut

[h1]II. Optimize game content[/h1]
1. Add more game content guidance instructions;

Welcome everyone to make positive comments and provide valuable suggestions and feedback. If you have any questions, we will reply immediately. Thank you for your attention and support!

[h1]I. Bug fixes[/h1]
1.Fix the bug of farmers disappearing after loading the game;
2.Fix the bug of not being able to load some items in the game correctly;
3.Fix the bug of incorrect offline reward value;
4.Fix the bug of can't operate editing mode and hierarchical mode

[h1]II. Optimize game content[/h1]
1.Add game resolution replacement options;
2.Adjust some visual effects and add special effects for motorcycle supplies

Welcome everyone to make positive comments and provide valuable suggestions and feedback. If you have any questions, we will reply immediately. Thank you for your attention and support!

[h1]I. Bug fixes[/h1]
1.Repair the bug of loading interface occasionally lagging and unable to enter the game;
2. Repair the bug of still being able to hear some of the sound effects after the sound effect is set to 0

[h1]II. Optimize game content[/h1]
1. Improve the farmer's collection enthusiasm and reduce the excessive accumulation of fruits in the game scene;
2. Adjust the fruit collection mechanism, now collect with just one click;
3. Add the text description of some functional modules in the game;
4. Adjust some UI effects;
5. Adjust the visual effect when butterflies cannot be collected.

Welcome to actively comment, put forward your valuable suggestions and feedback, there are any problems we will reply instantly, thank you for your attention and support!
